    title: "tracker TUI test_cancel_returns_none fails intermittently only under the loaded full-suite run (_result stays at the 'NOT_SET' sentinel); it is what reddens the cron aggregate"  # a8ef
    status: todo_hard  # a8ef
    priority: 2  # a8ef
